          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Alliance</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Adora has struggled to move on after Catra and Weaver's deaths, and made one mistake that many do. Underestimating Frosta.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It's time to enter the Hunter's Dream and meet this so called Hunter's Alliance...&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
